{"4301960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroic Sports Football : Enhanced Edition", "steam_appid": 4301960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/65fa3dabef8bfd98baea9913199d86e6.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <strong>Swords and Sandals</strong> comes a football game with <i>very few</i> rules, on field fatalities and hectic matches that end up more like bloodbaths. <strong>Heroic Sports Football : Enhanced Edition</strong> is the remedy against stat-heavy, lumbering football simulations. It’s football the way it should be played : chaotic and brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/ce39c21fad5bc41777aaa35640742da9.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your team with everything from battle-axes and centurion helmets to army boots and flak-jackets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own club : Select a team of up to 7 players, including a fully customizable Star Player, design your own team logo and club colours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to play in teams of 4, 5, 6 or 7 a side!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/bfbfebbf24b06f0e0d306a398c81131d.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against 50 teams through 5 divisions – from the hapless Sunday Park League to the All World Championships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade players, manage salaries an draft from a large pool of simulated players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full football management. View league leaderboards, schedules, simulate matches and manage salaries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/ac9307c6f58a0a3a8f90411e663c393f.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on seven different field types including Grass, Metal, Ice and Lunar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect on-field power ups from speed boosts right through to devastating nukes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge hazards such as toxic sludge, lava pits and oil slicks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can injure the other team so badly they'll be taken out of the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/5df4a7c011e92ef1fb62f4b029fe6405.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of you may recognize this game from the ancient days of <i><strong>Flash</strong></i>. I first made a demo of it in 2009, but it's been long gone from the internet. Surprisingly enough though, a lot people still ask me for it! So, I've finally got my act together and cleaned it up to play (relatively) nicely on a PC. I've added a bunch of modern conveniences like widescreen, keyboard customization and so on, but I'm not going to lie to you and say this is the next <i><strong>FIFA.</strong></i> Hell, its not even the next <strong><i>Sensible Soccer. </i></strong>Quell your expectations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacing said that, - it's fun. It's  quirky as hell, with all the janky weirdness you'd expect from a Flash game made in 2009. But if you liked <i><strong>Swords and Sandals</strong></i> and want to see my take on football ( more like <i><strong>Speedball</strong></i> really! ), then Heroic Sports Football is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/65fa3dabef8bfd98baea9913199d86e6.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <strong>Swords and Sandals</strong> comes a football game with <i>very few</i> rules, on field fatalities and hectic matches that end up more like bloodbaths. <strong>Heroic Sports Football : Enhanced Edition</strong> is the remedy against stat-heavy, lumbering football simulations. It’s football the way it should be played : chaotic and brutal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/fb06329997f4197dc4e44795f0154420.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/ce39c21fad5bc41777aaa35640742da9.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your team with everything from battle-axes and centurion helmets to army boots and flak-jackets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own club : Select a team of up to 7 players, including a fully customizable Star Player, design your own team logo and club colours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to play in teams of 4, 5, 6 or 7 a side!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/7145353e470e8793cee3da8ce841a413.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/bfbfebbf24b06f0e0d306a398c81131d.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against 50 teams through 5 divisions – from the hapless Sunday Park League to the All World Championships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade players, manage salaries an draft from a large pool of simulated players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full football management. View league leaderboards, schedules, simulate matches and manage salaries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.poster.avif?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.webm?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/a56ca8e0cc36222ecd205fd69db18ee2.mp4?t=1787911898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/ac9307c6f58a0a3a8f90411e663c393f.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on seven different field types including Grass, Metal, Ice and Lunar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect on-field power ups from speed boosts right through to devastating nukes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge hazards such as toxic sludge, lava pits and oil slicks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can injure the other team so badly they'll be taken out of the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301960/extras/5df4a7c011e92ef1fb62f4b029fe6405.webp?t=1787911898\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of you may recognize this game from the ancient days of <i><strong>Flash</strong></i>. I first made a demo of it in 2009, but it's been long gone from the internet. Surprisingly enough though, a lot people still ask me for it! So, I've finally got my act together and cleaned it up to play (relatively) nicely on a PC. I've added a bunch of modern conveniences like widescreen, keyboard customization and so on, but I'm not going to lie to you and say this is the next <i><strong>FIFA.</strong></i> Hell, its not even the next <strong><i>Sensible Soccer. </i></strong>Quell your expectations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacing said that, - it's fun. It's  quirky as hell, with all the janky weirdness you'd expect from a Flash game made in 2009. But if you liked <i><strong>Swords and Sandals</strong></i> and want to see my take on football ( more like <i><strong>Speedball</strong></i> really! ), then Heroic Sports Football is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "With very few rules, on field fatalities and quick, hectic matches, Heroic Sports Football : Enhanced Edition is the remedy against stat-heavy, lumbering football simulations. It’s football the way it should be played. Pure brutal adrenaline charged fun.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite